data-tex=\"h\">\\(h\\)</span> 的值通过正文的成员递归方程约束。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\check x\">\\(\\check x\\)</span> 在五元谓词中是候选输出，并非未定义的预设函数值。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing\\text{-}canonical\\text{-}check\\text{-}name} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcForcingCanonicalCheckName}_S(\\check{x},x,\\mathbb{P},\\leq_{\\mathbb P},1_{\\mathbb P})\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcForcing2ForcingPoset}_S(\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P},1_{\\mathbb P})\\land \\mathrm{Name}(\\check x,\\mathbb P)\\land\\exists T,h\\;\\Bigl(x\\in T\\land\\forall z\\in T\\;(z\\subseteq T)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(h,T,\\operatorname{ran}(h))\n\\land\\forall z\\in T\\;h(z)=\\{\\langle h(y),1_{\\mathbb P}\\rangle:y\\in z\\}\n\\land\\check x=h(x)\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing\\text{-}canonical\\text{-}check\\text{-}name} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcForcingCanonicalCheckName}_S(\\check{x},x,\\mathbb{P},\\leq_{\\mathbb P},1_{\\mathbb P})\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcForcing2ForcingPoset}_S(\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P},1_{\\mathbb P})\\land \\mathrm{Name}(\\check x,\\mathbb P)\\land\\exists T,h\\;\\Bigl(x\\in T\\land\\forall z\\in T\\;(z\\subseteq T)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(h,T,\\operatorname{ran}(h))\n\\land\\forall z\\in T\\;h(z)=\\{\\langle h(y),1_{\\mathbb P}\\rangle:y\\in z\\}\n\\land\\check x=h(x)\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing2\\text{-}canonical\\text{-}name\\text{-}alias} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcForcing2CanonicalName}_S(\\check x,x,\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P},1_{\\mathbb P})\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcForcingCanonicalCheckName}_S(\\check x,x,\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P},1_{\\mathbb P})\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing2\\text{-}canonical\\text{-}name\\text{-}alias} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcForcing2CanonicalName}_S(\\check x,x,\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P},1_{\\mathbb P})\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcForcingCanonicalCheckName}_S(\\check x,x,\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P},1_{\\mathbb P})\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing4\\text{-}canonical\\text{-}check\\text{-}name\\text{-}alias} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcForcing4CanonicalCheckName}_S(x,\\check x,\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P},1_{\\mathbb P})\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcForcingCanonicalCheckName}_S(\\check x,x,\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P},1_{\\mathbb P})\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing4\\text{-}canonical\\text{-}check\\text{-}name\\text{-}alias} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcForcing4CanonicalCheckName}_S(x,\\check x,\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P},1_{\\mathbb P})\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcForcingCanonicalCheckName}_S(\\check x,x,\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P},1_{\\mathbb P})\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing8\\text{-}canonical\\text{-}name\\text{-}alias} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcForcing8CanonicalName}_S(\\check x,x,\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P},1_{\\mathbb P})\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcForcingCanonicalCheckName}_S(\\check x,x,\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P},1_{\\mathbb P})\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing8\\text{-}canonical\\text{-}name\\text{-}alias} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcForcing8CanonicalName}_S(\\check x,x,\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P},1_{\\mathbb P})\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcForcingCanonicalCheckName}_S(\\check x,x,\\mathbb P,\\leq_